  {
   "i": 1,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 7.0,
   "t1": 13.7,
   "note": "\"What's going on guys? We're back at it again. So today we have a rally\" - host in the Cullinan"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "ch": "CH1",
   "t0": 13.7,
   "t1": 25.88,
   "note": "\"...as Supercar Experience offer, if you guys ever want to go on a big group / drive all these cars, go get dinner, show up, show out\""
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 25.88,
   "t1": 41.11,
   "note": "\"See, we have all the cars. Black Series, Mansory Uruses, Corvette, Huracan Evos, GT3s, Rolls-Royce Cullinan\" - CONVOY LOCK-ON hops car to car"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 41.11,
   "t1": 44.91,
   "note": "\"So right now, we're getting ready to meet the customers.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "ch": "CH2",
   "t0": 44.91,
   "t1": 54.09,
   "note": "\"If you ever need to book with us for a large event like this, as you can see, we're able to do it... let us know what you need and we'll make it happen\" - CTA chip TEXT OR DM TO BOOK"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "ch": "CH3",
   "t0": 54.09,
   "t1": 57.19,
   "note": "\"How you guys doing?\" \"Good. Good.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
